    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Abyss is a Traditional Roguelike with a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floors fall as you move around, limiting your movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.poster.avif?t=1752130195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.webm?t=1752130195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.mp4?t=1752130195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemy to drop resources. Every item dropped is unique to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/d1c13c50714cfdd098a16a449e5c6b9b.avif?t=1752130195\" width=261 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy also has an elite version, which has their own unique relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/1fb71be446fb188d5d542424cbeebebd.avif?t=1752130195\" width=300 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route down the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/4d70d4df656b57b411cf0821a08dc04e.avif?t=1752130195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the guardians of the abyss and discover the secrets behind the curse of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/c453413807b4d7c30241bd0739e23fd4.avif?t=1752130195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in development, content are expected to changed. However, here are what can be expected in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes with different features and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy will have their own unique item drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy will have a elite version and a unique relic that is dropped from the elite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome will have their own Guardian.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Campaign mode where it will feature some extraction elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Roguelike mode where you try to kill as many Guardians in a single run as possible.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be a highly tactical and spatial Traditional Roguelike, with heavy emphasis on resource management. There will be minimum to no meta progression, making players' skill the focus of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information will be available once the Demo is up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in active development, many of the features of the game is subjected to change. A steam demo is will be up shortly, so do add the game to your wishlist if you are interested and want to be notified when it is available. You can also join the <strong>Discord</strong> if you want to follow the development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/177969b87bb308002a5e7f8ddbccf3a0.poster.avif?t=1752130195\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/177969b87bb308002a5e7f8ddbccf3a0.apng?t=1752130195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=72 height=72 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Abyss is a Traditional Roguelike with a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floors fall as you move around, limiting your movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.poster.avif?t=1752130195\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.webm?t=1752130195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/17d1eee74e1a8dfb3553e5cda54f7d59.mp4?t=1752130195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemy to drop resources. Every item dropped is unique to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/d1c13c50714cfdd098a16a449e5c6b9b.avif?t=1752130195\" width=261 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy also has an elite version, which has their own unique relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/1fb71be446fb188d5d542424cbeebebd.avif?t=1752130195\" width=300 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route down the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/4d70d4df656b57b411cf0821a08dc04e.avif?t=1752130195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay the guardians of the abyss and discover the secrets behind the curse of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/c453413807b4d7c30241bd0739e23fd4.avif?t=1752130195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in development, content are expected to changed. However, here are what can be expected in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes with different features and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy will have their own unique item drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy will have a elite version and a unique relic that is dropped from the elite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome will have their own Guardian.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Campaign mode where it will feature some extraction elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Roguelike mode where you try to kill as many Guardians in a single run as possible.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be a highly tactical and spatial Traditional Roguelike, with heavy emphasis on resource management. There will be minimum to no meta progression, making players' skill the focus of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information will be available once the Demo is up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in active development, many of the features of the game is subjected to change. A steam demo is will be up shortly, so do add the game to your wishlist if you are interested and want to be notified when it is available. You can also join the <strong>Discord</strong> if you want to follow the development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/177969b87bb308002a5e7f8ddbccf3a0.poster.avif?t=1752130195\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678600/extras/177969b87bb308002a5e7f8ddbccf3a0.apng?t=1752130195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=72 height=72 /></picture></span></p>",
